[20.738, "o", "\r\n"]
[20.783, "o", "## Summary\r\n"]
[20.828, "o", "\r\n"]
[20.873, "o", "Add **first-class `rho` support** to dn so users can run `dn --agent rho` (and related env toggles) alongside OpenCode, Cursor, Claude Code, and Codex.\r\n"]
[20.918, "o", "\r\n"]
[20.963, "o", "This depends on the harness CLI already implemented in rho (`rho dn` subcommand).\r\n"]
[21.008, "o", "\r\n"]
